    "notes": [
      "This scenario is one of a deliberately paired hypothesis test. Heaney & Fisher (2003, Geology 31:323-326) reject quartz pseudomorphism after pre-existing crocidolite and interpret synchronous quartz-crocidolite growth by antitaxial crack-seal vein filling.",
